      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BINNAWAY PEARL (5) goes very well this trip starting 55 times for 22 wins and 25 minors. Recorded a neck win (16.81) in a OPEN last time at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. RICKI'S BURNER (2) missed the frame latest when sixth at Murray Bridge (17.26) but was a winner five back in the second best time of the program. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. OUTSHINE (6) goes very well this trip starting 58 times for 20 wins and 21 minors. In the money last time at Murray Bridge (17.00) in a Grade 5, finishing a 1.5 lengths third. Makes strong appeal on best. PAW OLLIE (1) will make his presence felt following a brief layoff.",
